---
/**
 * @category Testimonials
 * @theme classic
 * @name Testimonials
 */
---
<section
  class='bg-stone-50 px-2 py-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:px-4 sm:py-12 sm:gap-8 md:px-8 md:py-16 lg:px-16 lg:py-8'
>
  <div class='px-0 sm:px-4'>
    <h2
      class='text-stone-800 font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-center leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-3xl sm:leading-tight md:text-4xl md:leading-none md:tracking-[-0.02em] lg:text-5xl lg:leading-none lg:tracking-[-1.44px]'
    >
      What Our Customers Say
    </h2>
  </div>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-4 md:gap-x-8 md:gap-y-4'>
    <div class='p-2 sm:p-4'>
      <div
        class='border border-stone-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-4 sm:px-6'
      >
        <p
          class='text-stone-500 font-semibold text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg sm:leading-6 md:text-xl'
        >
          Starquix transformed our marketing efforts. We went from juggling
          multiple tools to managing all our landing pages seamlessly. The
          drag-and-drop interface is a game-changer. Our lead conversions have
          never been higher.
        </p>
        <div>
          <div
            class='flex flex-row gap-4 mt-6 items-center'
          >
            <img
              src='/assets/userpics/userpic01.webp'
              class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full sm:w-12 sm:h-12'
              alt='Riley Thompson'
            />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p
                class='text-stone-800 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg'
              >
                Riley Thompson
              </p>
              <p
                class='text-stone-500 text-sm sm:text-base'
              >
                CPO, CloudLeap Inc.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='p-2 sm:p-4'>
      <div
        class='border border-stone-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-4 sm:px-6'
      >
        <p
          class='text-stone-500 font-semibold text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg sm:leading-6 md:text-xl'
        >
          Switching to Starquix was the best decision we made this year. It's
          user-friendly, and the customization options are endless. Our landing
          pages are now much more engaging, and our bounce rate has dropped
          significantly.
        </p>
        <div>
          <div
            class='flex flex-row gap-4 mt-6 items-center'
          >
            <img
              src='/assets/userpics/userpic02.webp'
              class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full sm:w-12 sm:h-12'
              alt='Alex Johnson'
            />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p
                class='text-stone-800 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg'
              >
                Matt Webster
              </p>
              <p
                class='text-stone-500 text-sm sm:text-base'
              >
                CMO, BrightPath Marketing
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='p-2 sm:p-4'>
      <div
        class='border border-stone-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-4 sm:px-6'
      >
        <p
          class='text-stone-500 font-semibold text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg sm:leading-6 md:text-xl'
        >
          We tried several landing page builders, but Starquix is in a league of
          its own. The ability to create, test, and optimize pages in real-time
          has given us an edge over the competition.
        </p>
        <div>
          <div
            class='flex flex-row gap-4 mt-6 items-center'
          >
            <img
              src='/assets/userpics/userpic03.webp'
              class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full sm:w-12 sm:h-12'
              alt='Sarah Lee'
            />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p
                class='text-stone-800 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg'
              >
                Jason Alexander
              </p>
              <p
                class='text-stone-500 text-sm sm:text-base'
              >
                CTO, WebSprout Solutions
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='p-2 sm:p-4'>
      <div
        class='border border-stone-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-4 sm:px-6'
      >
        <p
          class='text-stone-500 font-semibold text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg sm:leading-6 md:text-xl'
        >
          Starquix helped us streamline our campaign launches. The templates are
          modern and easy to tweak. Our team can now create high-converting
          landing pages without relying on developers.
        </p>
        <div>
          <div
            class='flex flex-row gap-4 mt-6 items-center'
          >
            <img
              src='/assets/userpics/userpic04.webp'
              class='w-10 h-10 rounded-full sm:w-12 sm:h-12'
              alt='Mike Chen'
            />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p
                class='text-stone-800 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg'
              >
                Mike Chen
              </p>
              <p
                class='text-stone-500 text-sm sm:text-base'
              >
                CTO, DataDrive Systems
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
